  "Earlier Engineering editions store source records, item-source provenance, category, region and briefing copy, but not ranked candidate lists or deterministic scoring components. No numeric score is shown when one would be unsupported.": "较早的工程期刊保留来源记录、条目与来源的溯源关系、分类、地区和简报文字，但未保留排序候选清单或确定性评分分项。缺乏依据时不展示数值评分。",
  "These records are retained public sources in the static Engineering Briefing file. Scored editions use approved-source candidate collection before scoring. Registry-reconstructed historical editions use the approved Engineering source registry, exact weekly filters, relevance filtering and duplicate/event grouping; older retained-record reconstructions are labeled separately when present. This is not a scraped market database and should not be read as complete news coverage.": "这些记录是静态工程简报文件中留存的公开来源。评分期刊先从获准来源采集候选，再进行评分。按来源名录重建的历史期刊采用获准工程来源名录、精确周次筛选、相关性筛选及重复记录与事件分组；较早的留存记录重建会另行标注。这不是抓取生成的市场数据库，也不代表完整新闻覆盖。",
