  "This page displays a static local copy of one selected historical demonstration edition from the deterministic pipeline. It is not a complete record of weekly historical coverage and does not include AI-written summaries, editorial analysis, or automatic publication.": "本页展示确定性流水线生成的某一期历史示范期刊的本地静态副本。它不是完整的历史周度覆盖记录，也不包含 AI 撰写的摘要、编辑分析或自动发布。",
  "Source-backed engineering highlights for floating offshore wind. This prototype is independent from the deterministic Research Digest.": "有来源依据的浮式海上风电工程要闻。本原型独立于确定性的研究摘要。",
